## Install

1. Drop the `Scripts/` folder into your project's `Assets/`.
2. Add the `{{ s.name }}` component to a persistent GameObject (e.g. a `GameManager`).
{% if variant == "checkpoint" %}
3. Assign the **player** Transform in the inspector. Call `SetCheckpoint()` at checkpoints
   and `Respawn()` on death.
{% elif variant == "save_slots" %}
3. Call `Save(slot)` / `Load(slot)` with a slot index in `0..{{ s.slot_count - 1 }}`.
{% elif variant == "autosave" %}
3. State auto-loads on `Awake`, autosaves every {{ "%.0f"|format(s.autosave_interval) }}s,
   and saves on quit/pause. Call `Save()` manually anytime too.
{% else %}
3. State auto-loads on `Awake`. Call `Save()` / `Load()` when you need to persist or restore.
{% endif %}

